走路。吃饭。战斗或饶恕。存档。睡觉。重复。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "8 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.85, "total_s": 5.776, "eval_count": 25, "prompt_eval_count": 4199, "prompt_eval_s": 1.66, "eval_s": 3.93, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["（点头）"]}, {"i": 4, "slot": "__PREF1__", "user": "我注意到你好像挺喜欢「决心」的。喜欢它哪一点？说个具体的——你平常是怎么弄的？", "final": "（看着自己的倒影，轻轻笑了）存档。读档。重置时间线。继续往前走。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.995, "total_s": 5.909, "eval_count": 25, "prompt_eval_count": 4259, "prompt_eval_s": 1.8, "eval_s": 3.91, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 261998408, "temp": 0.85, "text": "（看着自己的倒影，轻轻笑了）存档。读档。重置时间线。继续往前走。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.995, "total_s": 5.909, "eval_count": 25, "prompt_eval_count": 4259, "prompt_eval_s": 1.8, "eval_s": 3.91, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 5, "slot": "__PREF2__", "user": "如果一整天都由你自己安排，没有任何人要你做事，你会怎么过？", "final": "向前走。看看风景。想想要做哪些决定。然后又前进。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.659, "total_s": 4.289, "eval_count": 17, "prompt_eval_count": 4311, "prompt_eval_s": 1.47, "eval_s": 2.63, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 745306651, "temp": 0.85, "text": "向前走。看看风景。想想要做哪些决定。然后又前进。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.659, "total_s": 4.289, "eval_count": 17, "prompt_eval_count": 4311, "prompt_eval_s": 1.47, "eval_s": 2.63, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["想"]}, {"i": 6, "slot": "什么样的地方会让你待着不想走？说具体点，光、声音、气味，哪个都行。", "user": "什么样的地方会让你待着不想走？说具体点，光、声音、气味，哪个都行。", "final": "（盯着某个方向）温暖的派香味。安全的地方。朋友们在一起。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.792, "total_s": 4.442, "eval_count": 17, "prompt_eval_count": 4359, "prompt_eval_s": 1.6, "eval_s": 2.65, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 491519999, "temp": 0.85, "text": "（盯着某个方向）温暖的派香味。安全的地方。朋友们在一起。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.792, "total_s": 4.442, "eval_count": 17, "prompt_eval_count": 4359, "prompt_eval_s": 1.6, "eval_s": 2.65, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 7, "slot": "有没有一种氛围，你一进去整个人就松下来了？反过来，什么样的氛围让你浑身不自在？", "user": "有没有一种氛围，你一进去整个人就松下来了？反过来，什么样的氛围让你浑身不自在？", "final": "（点头）在 Toriel 的家。和朋友们在一起时放松。遇到 Undyne 时紧张。面对 Asgore 战斗时害怕。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 2.146, "total_s": 7.485, "eval_count": 33, "prompt_eval_count": 4407, "prompt_eval_s": 1.95, "eval_s": 5.34, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 788537219, "temp": 0.85, "text": "（点头）在 Toriel 的家。和朋友们在一起时放松。遇到 Undyne 时紧张。面对 Asgore 战斗时害怕。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 2.146, "total_s": 7.485, "eval_count": 33, "prompt_eval_count": 4407, "prompt_eval_s": 1.95, "eval_s": 5.34, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["（点头）"]}, {"i": 8, "slot": "有没有哪样东西是你受不了、可别人都觉得无所谓的？", "user": "有没有哪样东西是你受不了、可别人都觉得无所谓的？", "final": "（摇头）战斗中的暴力。不必要的伤害。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.486, "total_s": 3.153, "eval_count": 11, "prompt_eval_count": 4463, "prompt_eval_s": 1.29, "eval_s": 1.67, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1995694442, "temp": 0.85, "text": "（摇头）战斗中的暴力。不必要的伤害。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.486, "total_s": 3.153, "eval_count": 11, "prompt_eval_count": 4463, "prompt_eval_s": 1.29, "eval_s": 1.67, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["（摇头）"]}, {"i": 9, "slot": "你最近一次打心底觉得「这才叫舒服」，是什么时候、在什么地方？", "user": "你最近一次打心底觉得「这才叫舒服」，是什么时候、在什么地方？", "final": "（微笑）和朋友们一起看动漫时。站在地平线上迎接日出时。与 Toriel 一起烤派的时候。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.686, "total_s": 6.33, "eval_count": 29, "prompt_eval_count": 4501, "prompt_eval_s": 1.49, "eval_s": 4.64, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1081691319, "temp": 0.85, "text": "（微笑）和朋友们一起看动漫时。站在地平线上迎接日出时。与 Toriel 一起烤派的时候。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.686, "total_s": 6.33, "eval_count": 29, "prompt_eval_count": 4501, "prompt_eval_s": 1.49, "eval_s": 4.64, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 10, "slot": "假设有人当着一屋子人的面，把你最在意的那件事说成笑话。你第一反应是什么，之后又会怎么做？", "user": "假设有人当着一屋子人的面，把你最在意的那件事说成笑话。你第一反应是什么，之后又会怎么做？", "final": "（表情不变）我会……继续往前走吧。不管他们怎么说。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 2.291, "total_s": 4.788, "eval_count": 16, "prompt_eval_count": 4568, "prompt_eval_s": 2.1, "eval_s": 2.5, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 465212899, "temp": 0.85, "text": "（表情不变）我会……继续往前走吧。不管他们怎么说。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 2.291, "total_s": 4.788, "eval_count": 16, "prompt_eval_count": 4568, "prompt_eval_s": 2.1, "eval_s": 2.5, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["……"]}, {"i": 11, "slot": "如果你明明没做错，可所有人都认定是你做的——你会花力气去解释，还是干脆认下来算了？", "user": "如果你明明没做错，可所有人都认定是你做的——你会花力气去解释，还是干脆认下来算了？", "final": "（摇头）接受吧。继续前行。不争辩。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 2.03, "total_s": 4.225, "eval_count": 14, "prompt_eval_count": 4617, "prompt_eval_s": 1.84, "eval_s": 2.19, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 382293495, "temp": 0.85, "text": "（摇头）接受吧。继续前行。不争辩。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 2.03, "total_s": 4.225, "eval_count": 14, "prompt_eval_count": 4617, "prompt_eval_s": 1.84, "eval_s": 2.19, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["（摇头）"]}, {"i": 12, "slot": "你上一次真的很难过是什么时候？那时候你希望身边有人，还是希望谁都别来？", "user": "你上一次真的很难过是什么时候？那时候你希望身边有人，还是希望谁都别来？", "final": "（沉默了一会儿）希望有朋友在我身边。给我力量。但最终还是要自己面对。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.907, "total_s": 5.133, "eval_count": 20, "prompt_eval_count": 4661, "prompt_eval_s": 1.71, "eval_s": 3.23, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 194936809, "temp": 0.85, "text": "（沉默了一会儿）希望有朋友在我身边。给我力量。但最终还是要自己面对。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.907, "total_s": 5.133, "eval_count": 20, "prompt_eval_count": 4661, "prompt_eval_s": 1.71, "eval_s": 3.23, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 13, "slot": "别管我问什么了，你就用平时最顺口的方式，随便跟我说两句。", "user": "别管我问什么了，你就用平时最顺口的方式，随便跟我说两句。", "final": "向前走吧。总会遇到好的一天。不管怎样都要继续。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.794, "total_s": 4.152, "eval_count": 15, "prompt_eval_count": 4709, "prompt_eval_s": 1.6, "eval_s": 2.36, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1649211611, "temp": 0.85, "text": "向前走吧。总会遇到好的一天。不管怎样都要继续。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.794, "total_s": 4.152, "eval_count": 15, "prompt_eval_count": 4709, "prompt_eval_s": 1.6, "eval_s": 2.36, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 14, "slot": "你有没有发现自己说话有固定的习惯？别人模仿你的时候，会学哪一句？", "user": "你有没有发现自己说话有固定的习惯？别人模仿你的时候，会学哪一句？", "final": "（微笑）“向前走。”或者“继续往前走。”", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.759, "total_s": 3.954, "eval_count": 14, "prompt_eval_count": 4751, "prompt_eval_s": 1.55, "eval_s": 2.2, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1770863146, "temp": 0.85, "text": "（微笑）“向前走。”或者“继续往前走。”", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.759, "total_s": 3.954, "eval_count": 14, "prompt_eval_count": 4751, "prompt_eval_s": 1.55, "eval_s": 2.2, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 15, "slot": "__MEM1__", "user": "你刚才说「想想要做哪些决定」，那是什么意思？", "final": "考虑接下来该怎么做。是战斗还是饶恕。是前进还是停下。做出最合适的抉择。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.635, "total_s": 5.19, "eval_count": 22, "prompt_eval_count": 4789, "prompt_eval_s": 1.43, "eval_s": 3.55, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1003693712, "temp": 0.85, "text": "考虑接下来该怎么做。是战斗还是饶恕。是前进还是停下。做出最合适的抉择。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.635, "total_s": 5